    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market this superb two-bedroom duplex apartment, ideally situated in the ever-popular Ivy Court development at Beaumont Woods.\nNo. 88 is presented in walk-in condition throughout and boasts a bright and spacious interior, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to downsize. A particular feature of the property is the west-facing balcony overlooking the beautifully maintained communal gardens, providing an excellent outdoor space and enjoying afternoon and evening sunshine.\nThe accommodation extends to approximately 79 sq. m. (850 sq. ft.) and comprises an entrance hallway, generous open-plan kitchen/dining/living room with French doors opening onto the balcony, two well-proportioned double bedrooms, main bedroom with en-suite shower room, and a family bathroom.\nThe property further benefits from designated parking, electric heating and well-maintained communal grounds. \nThe location is second to none, with Beaumont Hospital just a short distance away. There are a host of local amenities nearby including shops, cafés, restaurants and recreational facilities, while excellent public transport links provide easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. Dublin Airport, DCU and the M1 motorway are also within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 2.72m x 1.81m\nCarpeted.\n\nKitchen - 3.02m x 3.67m\nTiled kitchen floor and splashback, fully fitted kitchen.\n\nDining Area - 3.45m x 2.40m\nLaminate wood flooring, French doors to the west facing balcony.\n\nLiving Room - 2.72m x 5.56m\nLaminate wood flooring.\n\nBalcony - 2.95m x 2.60m\nPrivate west facing balcony overlooking the landscaped communal gardens. Artificial grass flooring.\n\nLanding - 1.13m x 2.76m\nCarpeted, large feature window.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.63m x 4.61m\nSolid wood flooring, built in wardrobes.\n\nEn Suite - 1.70m x 1.64m\nLinoleum flooring, corner shower, WC, WHB.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.42m x 3.74m\nSolid wood flooring, built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.55m x 2.24m\nFully tiled, WC, WHB, bath.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Electric heating</li><li> Double glazed uPVC windows</li><li> Designated parking</li><li> Private west facing balcony overlooking communal gardens</li><li> Recently redecorated to a high standard</li><li> Management fees approx. 1,280 p.a.</ul>"
      },
